# Row k lit in Clean Teal, whose k (--param-k) lies outside sRGB and Display P3 both: the pointer
# onto k's name, row k at (49, 446.5, 394, 44) at 1440 x 900 (the reference's DOM). One frame
# later the row has its band (k at 18 %), its name in --foreground and its box's stroke at 2 px,
# on the reference as on the port. `tools/run gamut M5a` checks the band's P3 bytes.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme light
mode light
theme clean-teal
wait 2000
move 200 468
wait 16
shot hover
